{"id":"n61142-1-7","stage":1,"title":"삼촌 · 叔叔","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61142-1-7-1","ko":"삼촌, 우리 아빠는 어렸을 때 어땠어요?","zh":"叔叔，我们爸爸小时候是什么样的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"삼촌,","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아빠는","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5d1a410b7ca871d4","term":"삼촌","zh":"叔叔，舅舅","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3","entryId":"61142","definition":"用于指称或称呼父母的兄弟。","pronunciation":["삼촌"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c9f209994786f50d","term":"아빠","zh":"爸爸","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3","entryId":"26148","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼父亲。","pronunciation":["아빠"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/675dfe112ff29e1c117e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61142-1-7-2","ko":"형은 어렸을 때부터 공부를 잘하는 모범생이었어.","zh":"哥哥从小时候起就是学习优异的模范生。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형은","meaning":"哥，哥哥","explanation":"형：哥，哥哥；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"1","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때부터","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘하는","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모범생이었어.","meaning":"模范生","explanation":"모범생：模范生；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모범생","audio":"/audio/6a245a0fbbb31b0f16df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55803","senseId":"1","lemma":"모범생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥，哥哥","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]},{"id":"6a245a0fbbb31b0f","term":"모범생","zh":"模范生","audio":"/audio/6a245a0fbbb31b0f16df.mp3","entryId":"55803","definition":"学业和品行出众，能成为众同学榜样的学生。","pronunciation":["모범생"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc2d001a447fcbec050c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61142","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":44,"sequenceScore":1.9501,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哥哥从小时候起就是学习优异的模范生。","叔叔，我们爸爸小时候是什么样的呢？","司机师傅，下个路口请向右转。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["叔叔，我们爸爸小时候是什么样的呢？","司机师傅，下个路口请向右转。","哥哥从小时候起就是学习优异的模范生。"],"answer":2}]}
